{"page": 1407, "total_pages": 1510, "total": 75500, "skills": [{"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1779462078192, "description": "Use when the user wants the current thread logged into a project-local Markdown file, one file per conversation, with timestamps, verbatim user prompts, and one-sentence assistant reply summaries.", "description_zh": "Use when the user wants the current thread logged into a project-local Markdown file, one file per conversation, with timestamps, verbatim user prompts, and one-sentence assistant reply summaries.", "downloads": 78, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_a0bf454f/shangui666", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/81015f94-5620-494e-bbd6-ac3268e7ccd3.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Log Current Conversation", "ownerName": "user_a0bf454f", "score": 14498.14126394052, "slug": "shangui666", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781057050466, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.3"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1779550788697, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 78, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_70c2f807/second-hand-disposal-guide", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "旧物处理指南", "ownerName": "user_70c2f807", "score": 12302.839116719242, "slug": "second-hand-disposal-guide", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781052850415, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.2"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1780809117277, "description": "完整流程：采集数据 → 生成 Word 日报 → 生成 PPT 简报 → 发送邮件。 当用户说\"生成每日金融日报\"、\"生成今日日报\"、\"生成晨报\"时触发。", "description_zh": "<think>\nWe needto translate the given description into concise Chinese. The user wants JSON only: {\"description_zh\":\"...\"}.The description:\n\n\"完整流程：采集数据 → 生成 Word 日报 → 生成 PPT 简报 → 发送邮件。 当用户说\"生成每日金融日报\"、\"生成今日日报\"、\"生成晨报\"时触发。\"\n\nWe need concise Chinese. Possibly: \"完整流程：采集数据 → 生成 Word 日报 → 生成 PPT 简报 → 发送邮件。触发关键词：“生成每日金融日报”“生成今日日报”“生成晨报”。\"\n\nBut maybe we can phrase concisely: \"完整流程：采集数据 → 生成 Word 日报 → 生成 PPT 简报 → 发送邮件。触发词：“生成每日金融日报”“生成今日日报”“生成晨报”。\"\n\nWe want concise Chinese. We'll produce JSON with description_zh containing this translation.\n\nMake sure JSON format correct. Use proper escaping if needed. Since it's Chinese, no need for escape. Use doublequotes for JSON keys.\n\nThus output:\n\n{\n  \"description_zh\": \"完整流程：采集数据 → 生成 Word 日报 → 生成 PPT 简报 → 发送邮件。触发词：“生成每日金融日报”“生成今日日报”“生成晨报”。\"\n}\n\nMake sure to remove extra spaces? It's fine.\n\nPotential improvements: Useshort version: \"完整流程：采集数据 → 生成 Word 日报 → 生成 PPT 简报 → 发送邮件。触发关键词：生成每日金融日报、生成今日日报、生成晨报。\"\n\nConcise: \"完整流程：采集数据 → 生成 Word 日报 → 生成 PPT 简报 → 发送邮件。触发词：生成每日金融日报、生成今日日报、生成晨报。\"\n\nBut maybe \"触发词\" is okay. They used \"当用户说...\". The translation should reflect that.\n\nThus answer: JSONonly.\n\nWe'll provide exactly JSON.\n</think>\n\n```json\n{\n  \"description_zh\": \"完整流程：采集数据 → 生成 Word 日报 → 生成 PPT 简报 → 发送邮件。触发词：生成每日金融日报、生成今日日报、生成晨报。\"\n}\n```", "downloads": 78, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/szrw1825/daily-financial-report", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": null, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "生成每日金融日报", "ownerName": "szrw1825", "score": 9198.113207547169, "slug": "daily-financial-report", "source": "clawhub", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781051783967, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1779613980526, "descri