udio, video, installation, performance), giving outside perspectiive via abundant...\". Let's translate.\n\nWe might try: \"帮助艺术家对其作品（图像、文字、音频、视频、装置、表演等）进行艺术评论，提供丰富的外部视角\". Thatis concise.\n\nThus output: {\"description_zh\":\"帮助艺术家对其作品（图像、文字、音频、视频、装置、表演等）进行艺术评论，提供丰富的外部视角\"}.\n\nShould we include ellipsis?Probably not. We can end with \"等\" and maybe \"。\" at end. It'sokay.\n\nThus final.\n</think>\n\n```json\n{\"description_zh\":\"帮助艺术家对其作品（图像、文字、音频、视频、装置、表演等）进行艺术评论，提供丰富的外部视角\"}\n```", "downloads": 78, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/iiiantower/art-critique-skill", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 1, "labels": null, "last_synced_at": 1781002987330, "name": "Art Critique", "ownerName": "iiiantower", "score": 12380.952380952382, "slug": "art-critique-skill", "source": "clawhub", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781036484028, "upstream_owner_login": "iiiantower", "upstream_url": "https://clawhub.ai/iiiantower/art-critique-skill", "verified": false, "version": "1.0.1"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1779614473459, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 78, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_70c2f807/procrastination-intervention", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/81015f94-5620-494e-bbd6-ac3268e7ccd3.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "拖延症深层干预", "ownerName": "user_70c2f807", "score": 10249.671484888306, "slug": "procrastination-intervention", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781034877776, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1779102765154, "description": "当用户输入灵感、想法、创意、念头、待验证创意时触发。此Skill自动识别内容类型，整理成结构化Markdown记录，并保存到电脑桌面的\"灵感库\"文件夹。支持工作创意、生活灵感、投资想法、项目灵感、产品点子等多